@startuml
@startuml
left to right direction
'https://plantuml.com/use-case-diagram

actor Editor
actor Player
actor ProductOwner

Editor --> (Create Map)
Editor --> (Add Industry)
Editor --> (Add City)
Editor --> (Create Scenario)

(Create Map) --> (Define Map Size) : <<include>>
(Create Map) --> (Set Map Name) : <<include>>
(Add Industry) --> (Specify Position XY) : <<include>>
(Add City) --> (Indicate Coordinates XY)
(Add City) --> (Set City Name) : <<include>>
(Add City) --> (Define House Blocks) : <<extend>>
(Set City Name) --> (No Special Characters/Digits) : <<extend>>
(Define House Blocks) --> (Must be Positive) : <<extend>>

Player --> (Build Station)
Player --> (Upgrade Station)
Player --> (View Station Details)
Player --> (Build Railway Line)
Player --> (Buy Train)
Player --> (Assign Train to Route)
Player --> (List Trains)

(Build Station) --> (Check Overbuilding) : <<include>>
(Build Railway Line) --> (Select Registered Stations) : <<include>>
(Buy Train) --> (Select Locomotive from List) : <<include>>
(Assign Train to Route) --> (Choose Valid Stations) : <<include>>
(Assign Train to Route) --> (Select Cargo for Pickup) : <<include>>
(List Trains) --> (Group by Locomotive Type) : <<extend>>
(List Trains) --> (Sort Alphabetically) : <<extend>>

ProductOwner --> (Cargo Generation Simulator)
(Cargo Generation Simulator) --> (Generate Cargo at Stations) : <<include>>
(Cargo Generation Simulator) --> (Consider Cities and Industries) : <<include>>
(Cargo Generation Simulator) --> (Provide Start/Pause Option) : <<include>>


@enduml
